        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/0bcbcfa9599c4019c7092ff276dd3bd0.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonfall Protocol</strong> is a fast-paced 1–4 player <strong>co-op survival</strong> horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are given a <strong>once-in-a-lifetime</strong> chance to walk on the <strong>moon</strong>. What starts as an exciting mission quickly turns into something worse. A hidden base, with strange astronauts guarding it, and a portal that pulls you into a <strong>twisted dimension</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, nothing stays the same. <br>The world shifts, entities stalk you, and every step feels like a race against time. <br>Work together to <strong>gather evidence</strong> of what really happened, <strong>coins to upgrade your abilities</strong>, and hunt down <strong>ten control points</strong> to power the generator that could send you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/74c67766aae1e5763f010eb7046b47af.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/74c67766aae1e5763f010eb7046b47af.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/74c67766aae1e5763f010eb7046b47af.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/603569bbebe03ad060b334bbdba1989a.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/603569bbebe03ad060b334bbdba1989a.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/603569bbebe03ad060b334bbdba1989a.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless alien horrors across the surface of the moon and beyond. <br>Every second counts as you and your team fight, run, and adapt to unpredictable threats in shifting environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/e72144c56d8737c774699ea41db9c55d.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/e72144c56d8737c774699ea41db9c55d.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/e72144c56d8737c774699ea41db9c55d.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/06e165f6456e62b2629f8f26dff1fb54.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/06e165f6456e62b2629f8f26dff1fb54.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/06e165f6456e62b2629f8f26dff1fb54.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission isn’t just to survive — it’s to uncover the truth. <br>Collect critical evidence hidden within the lunar base and strange dimensions, piece it together, and decide when it’s time to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/94cd45308a1c4324c7d9a5c6200aa847.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/94cd45308a1c4324c7d9a5c6200aa847.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/94cd45308a1c4324c7d9a5c6200aa847.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/6d794b1a1e536c07e31ae34b3b9a6698.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/6d794b1a1e536c07e31ae34b3b9a6698.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/6d794b1a1e536c07e31ae34b3b9a6698.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together or fall apart. Coordinate with your team to share discoveries, warn of incoming threats, and make sure everyone makes it back alive.  Sometimes, silence is just as powerful as shouting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/34078653520b8a58891fd9a077c8a549.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/34078653520b8a58891fd9a077c8a549.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/34078653520b8a58891fd9a077c8a549.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/f5daea9ef4124cbdedd226f2102c9187.poster.avif?t=1759262455\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/f5daea9ef4124cbdedd226f2102c9187.webm?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973560/extras/f5daea9ef4124cbdedd226f2102c9187.mp4?t=1759262455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards during your runs to unlock new gear, improve your speed, strength, and awareness, and increase your odds of surviving entities and challenges that come across.</p>",
